// Act 2 - Comms Array
// ===================

title: CommsArray_Arrival
tags: act2, commsarray, arrival
---
<<SetZone "CommsArray">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>

Astra: <<if $trust < 8>>
    [Projection resonates with dish hum]
    "Comms Array. Signal... intelligence. Origin... tracking."
    "Void Sail... here. Movement... organ. Dimensional bridge."
<<else>>
    "Comms Array. Two Vista Nodes. Array Control... Signal Analysis."
    "Signal Triangulation... and Archive Decryption. Puzzles... linked."
<</if>>

<<if not HasVisitedVistaNode "CommsArray_Control">>
    Astra: "Array Control. First node. Signal Triangulation puzzle."
    "Three dishes. Must... align. Triangulate... origin signal."
<<else>>
    Astra: "Array Control... complete. Signal Analysis... awaits."
<</if>>

-> Choice_CommsArray
===

title: Choice_CommsArray
---
+ [Approach Array Control] -> Node_CommsArray_Control_Approach
+ [Approach Signal Analysis] -> Node_CommsArray_Analysis_Approach
+ "What is the origin signal?" -> Dialogue_OriginSignal
+ "Tell me about the Void Sail." -> Dialogue_VoidSail
+ "Corwin... is he here?" -> Dialogue_CorwinComms
+ [Fast Travel] -> Command_ShowJournal_Map
===

title: Dialogue_OriginSignal
---
Astra: "The signal... is *me*. Or... was. My distress call."
"Sent... at crash. 1947. Scattered... across time."
"Each dish... catches a fragment. Aligned... reveals... location."
"Of the *Chronos*'s core. Of... the fracture's heart."
"Corwin... knows. He *built* this array. To find us."

-> Choice_CommsArray
===

title: Dialogue_VoidSail
---
Astra: "Void Sail... third organ. Movement. Dimensional bridge."
"Double jump. Glide. Phase... through barriers."
"In past... reach inaccessible nodes. In present... traverse... new paths."
"Chronos Core... time. Neural Loom... memory. Void Sail... *freedom*."

-> Choice_CommsArray
===

title: Dialogue_CorwinComms
---
Astra: "Corwin... Director. He oversees... all timelines."
"Here... 1957. He watches. Records. Calculates."
"He *chose* to stay. Anchor... for the fracture."
"Some... say he seeks redemption. Others... control."
"He knows... the signal. He knows... you."
"Trust... him? Or... use him?"

-> Choice_CommsArray
===

title: Node_CommsArray_Control_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "CommsArray_Control">>
Astra: "Array Control. Three dishes. Bearings... calculated."
"Dish 1: 45.2°. Dish 2: 137.8°. Dish 3: 284.5°."
"Target... origin signal. Triangulation... required."

-> Phase_Shift_CommsArray_Control
===

title: Phase_Shift_CommsArray_Control
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "CommsArray_Control">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_CommsArray_Control">>

Astra: "1957. Array... online. Signal... detected."
"Puzzle: **Signal Triangulation**. Align dishes. Decode... coordinates."
"[Scan] each dish. Bearings... visible. Precision... required."

<<SetActivePuzzle "CommsArray_SignalTriangulation">>

-> Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Start
===

title: Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Start
---
Astra: "[Scan] Dish 1. Bearing... 45.2°. Signal... weak."
"[Scan] Dish 2. Bearing... 137.8°. Signal... moderate."
"[Scan] Dish 3. Bearing... 284.5°. Signal... strong."
"Intersection... calculates origin. But... frequency... modulated."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_DISH_BEARINGS">>

Astra: "Frequency... 7.83 Hz. Schumann resonance. Earth's... heartbeat."
"Modulation... three harmonics. Pattern... temporal."
"Command me: [Hold] at each dish. Match... frequency."

-> Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Step1
===

title: Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Step1
---
Astra: "Dish 1... aligned. Frequency... matched. Dish 2... next."
"[Hold] at Dish 2. Harmonic... second. Timing... precise."

// Player executes Hold at Dish 2
<<command RevealClue "CLUE_FREQUENCY_PATTERN">>

-> Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Step2
===

title: Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Step2
---
Astra: "Dish 2... synchronized. Dish 3... final. Strongest signal."
"[Hold] at Dish 3. Third harmonic. Window... narrow."

// Player executes Hold at Dish 3
<<command RevealClue "CLUE_BURST_TIMING">>

-> Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Step3
===

title: Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Step3
---
Astra: "Triangulation... complete. Origin... located. Sub-Level 0."
"But... transmission... required. Calibration burst."
"Command me: [Follow] through array. Relay... signal."
"Astra... becomes... the bridge."

Corwin: [Appears at Array Control]
"Impressive. The projection... navigates the signal. Autonomous."
"Thorne would have... appreciated this. Distributed consciousness."
"Your ship... the *Chronos*. It *is* the signal."
"Receive... and... *become*."

-> Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Follow
===

title: Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Follow
---
Astra: "[Follow] engaged. Relaying... through array path."
"Dish 1 → Dish 2 → Dish 3 → Ground station → Sub-Level 0."
"Signal... amplified. Coordinates... transmitted."

// Player executes Follow command - Astra moves through array

Corwin: "Transmission... received. At Sub-Level 0. They... know."
"The fracture... pulses. Responds. *Alive*."
"Navigator... you've woken it. Fully."

-> Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Complete
===

title: Puzzle_SignalTriangulation_Complete
---
Astra: "Transmission... complete. Void Sail... calibrated."
"Present... changed. Dishes... aligned. Path... to Hangar 18... open."

<<MarkPuzzleSolved "CommsArray_SignalTriangulation">>
<<AddResonance 250>>
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_7">>
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_8">>
<<AddTrust 2>>
<<GrantOrgan "VoidSail">>
<<SetAstraVisualState "unity">>

Astra: "VOID SAIL RESTORED."
"Double jump... unlocked. Glide... unlocked. Dimensional bridge... active."
"Hangar 18... accessible. Gravity Anchor... awaits."

<<SetEndingFlag "void_sail_restored" true>>
<<UnlockFastTravel "Hangar18">>

-> Phase_Shift_Return_CommsArray_Control
===

title: Phase_Shift_Return_CommsArray_Control
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "CommsArray_Control">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_CommsArray_Control_Return">>

Astra: "Present... Array aligned. Signal... clear. Bridge... to Hangar 18... extended."
"Three organs restored. One... remains."
"Gravity Anchor... in Hangar 18. Stasis... recovery."
"Navigator... gravity... bends."

-> Choice_CommsArray
===

title: Node_CommsArray_Analysis_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "CommsArray_Analysis">>
<<if not HasSolvedPuzzle "CommsArray_SignalTriangulation">>
    Astra: "Signal Analysis. Archive Decryption. But... Triangulation... incomplete."
    "Complete... Array Control first. Signal... before archive."
    -> Choice_CommsArray
<<else>>
    Astra: "Signal Analysis. Archive Decryption. Director's... personal logs."
    "Three cipher keys. Thorne. Reyes. Corwin. Temporal XOR... algorithm."
    -> Phase_Shift_CommsArray_Analysis
<</if>
===

title: Phase_Shift_CommsArray_Analysis
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "CommsArray_Analysis">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_CommsArray_Analysis">>

Astra: "1962. Cuban Missile Crisis. Facility... on high alert."
"Director Corwin... personal logs. Encrypted. Three keys."
"Puzzle: **Archive Decryption**. Decrypt... 1947-1962."

<<SetActivePuzzle "CommsArray_ArchiveDecryption">>

-> Puzzle_ArchiveDecryption_Start
===

title: Puzzle_ArchiveDecryption_Start
---
Astra: "[Scan] cipher terminal. Three key fragments... required."
"Key 1: Thorne. 'ASCENT'. Neural mapping... project."
"Key 2: Reyes. 'ANCHOR'. Security... protocol."
"Key 3: Corwin. 'CONTINUITY'. Fracture... management."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_CIPHER_KEYS">>

Astra: "Algorithm... Temporal XOR. Keys... time-dependent."
"Log dates... determine XOR mask. 1947... 1952... 1957... 1962."
"Command me: [Scan] each log terminal. Reveal... keys."

-> Puzzle_ArchiveDecryption_Execute
===

title: Puzzle_ArchiveDecryption_Execute
---
Astra: "Scanning... Thorne's terminal. 1947. Key... ASCENT."
"Scanning... Reyes's terminal. 1957. Key... ANCHOR."
"Scanning... Corwin's terminal. 1962. Key... CONTINUITY."
"Decrypting... logs. Temporal XOR... applied."

Corwin: [Voice from 1962 terminal]
"If you're reading this... you've broken my cipher."
"Good. Means you're *smart*. Or *desperate*."
"The fracture... cannot be contained. Only... managed."
"I chose... to stay. To watch. To *ensure*."
"Thorne died... for knowledge. Reyes died... for duty."
"I... survive. For *continuity*."

-> Puzzle_ArchiveDecryption_Complete
===

title: Puzzle_ArchiveDecryption_Complete
---
Astra: "Archive... decrypted. Logs... accessible. Truth... revealed."
"Corwin... knew. Everything. Every timeline. Every choice."
"Present... changed. Administration... accessible."

<<MarkPuzzleSolved "CommsArray_ArchiveDecryption">>
<<AddResonance 200>>
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_9">>
<<AddTrust 1>>
<<SetAstraVisualState "memory">>

Astra: "Memory... Corwin's choice. 1962. He *stayed*. Voluntarily."
"Administration... next. Director's Authorization... puzzle."
"Return... present."

<<UnlockFastTravel "Administration">>

-> Phase_Shift_Return_CommsArray_Analysis
===

title: Phase_Shift_Return_CommsArray_Analysis
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "CommsArray_Analysis">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_CommsArray_Analysis_Return">>

Astra: "Present... Administration accessible. Door... unsealed."
"Three organs. One remains. Gravity Anchor... Hangar 18."
"Navigator... the weight... approaches."

-> Choice_CommsArray
===